  "description": "Your forest is dying.\n\nPoisonous creatures crawl beneath ancient roots,\ncorrupt the air, and hunt your friends.\nBut they forgot one thing — this forest has a fairy protector.\n\nYou are the last spark of light in the darkness.\nEach wave of enemies grows faster, deadlier, and more overwhelming.\nThe screen fills with monsters, and there is nowhere left to run.\n\nDraw power from nature.\nLevel up.\nUnlock devastating spells, magical auras, and new abilities.\nWith every minute, you transform from a fragile fairy\ninto a storm of magic that wipes out everything in its path.\n\nThis isn’t just survival —\nit’s the fury of the forest unleashed.\n\nEasy to start. Impossible to stop.",
